Subject: [PATCH 0009/0014] Replace account auth with OIDC to the control plane

This patch replaces the Microsoft and GitHub authentication flows with
a generic OIDC flow against the control plane. The IDE receives a
short-lived signed token from the control plane on the WebSocket
upgrade, verifies it against the public key, and establishes the
session.

Token shape:
  iss https://code.jahaziel.dev, sub user-uuid, aud
  jahaziel-code-server, 15 minute TTL, jti session-uuid, wid
  workspace-uuid, scope workspace:read workspace:write.

Diff: authored on the upstream checkout (see build.sh).
Verification: session-auth smoke test with a gateway-issued token.
